Jump in the pond and splash a little bit!

19
00:01:33,333 --> 00:01:36,966
March, march, march through the jungle green,

20
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:40,600
The happiest animals you've ever seen!

21
00:01:40,966 --> 00:01:44,866
Wiggle your tail and flap your wings,

